    {
      "source": "The \"allowEmpty\" parameter controls whether an empty String is to be\nallowed in parsing, i.e. be interpreted as the <code>null</code> value when\n<a href=\"#setAsText(java.lang.String)\"><code>text is being converted</code></a>. If <code>false</code>,\nan <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalArgumentException</code></a> will be thrown at that time.",
      "translation": "\"allowEmpty\" 参数控制是否允许在解析时包含空 String，即在 <a href=\"#setAsText(java.lang.String)\"><code>将文本进行转换</code></a> 时将其解释为 <code>null</code> 值。如果设置为 <code>false</code>，届时将抛出 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalArgumentException</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that the JDK does not contain a default\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/PropertyEditor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.beans\"><code>property editor</code></a> for <code>char</code>!\n<a href=\"../BeanWrapperImpl.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans\"><code>BeanWrapperImpl</code></a> will register this\neditor by default.",
      "translation": "注意，JDK 中不包含用于 `<code>char</code>` 的默认 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/PropertyEditor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.beans\"><code>property editor</code></a>！<a href=\"../BeanWrapperImpl.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans\"><code>BeanWrapperImpl</code></a> 默认会注册此编辑器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Also supports conversion from a Unicode character sequence; for example,\n<code>u0041</code> ('A').",
      "translation": "同时也支持从 Unicode 字符序列转换；例如，`u0041`（'A'）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>allowEmpty</code> - if empty strings are to be allowed",
      "translation": "<code>allowEmpty</code> - 如果允许空字符串",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Juergen Hoeller, Rob Harrop, Rick Evans",
      "translation": "Juergen Hoeller, Rob Harrop, Rick Evans",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new CharacterEditor instance.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 CharacterEditor 实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
